# Norn's Annex: "Creatures can't attack you or planeswalkers you control unless their controller pays {W/P} for each of
# those creatures" (CR 508.1d, 508.1h). Bot2 casts it paying both of its own {W/P} with 4 life and controls Liliana of the
# Veil. On turn 3 Bot1 attacks Liliana with one Llanowar Elves and Bot2 with the other: {W/P}{W/P}, and the player chooses
# how each is paid (CR 107.4f; the rulings: "you may pay {W} for one cost and 2 life for the other"). Bot1 pays one with 2
# life and the other with Mox Pearl's {W}, which is the only mana spent: Mox Emerald and Forest stay untapped. Bot1 goes to
# 18, Liliana to 2 loyalty and Bot2 from 16 to 15.

